# Read: 93% of the 642 MiB is .nv_fatbin - precompiled cubins for five
# compute capabilities plus their PTX. The code is 10.6 MiB. The 1.32.0
# provider is 186.5 MiB with 128.8 MiB of fatbin because it targets five
# newer architectures (sm_75/80/86/89/120) instead of sm_60..sm_80.
